highway_primary.q:
[out:xml][timeout:15][bbox:{{bbox}}];
way[highway=primary][name];
out body;
out;




Multi-vehicle pileup on a major road involving several cars during foggy conditions. Immediate evacuation of a critical passenger is required. Fly to: {navaid_loc_desc} (distance: ~{distance}, bearing: {bearing_target}).
Late-night motorcycle crash left a rider unconscious with suspected spinal injuries. Immediate night flight extraction is needed. Fly to: {navaid_loc_desc} (distance: ~{distance}, bearing: {bearing_target}).
Suspect vehicle crashed during a police pursuit on a major road. Driver sustained major trauma, unconscious at the scene. Fly to: {navaid_loc_desc} (distance: ~{distance}, bearing: {bearing_target}).
A fuel tanker exploded following a collision. Burns and smoke inhalation injuries require urgent evacuation from the scene. Fly to: {navaid_loc_desc} (distance: ~{distance}, bearing: {bearing_target}).
Bicycle commuter hit by speeding car on morning rush hour. Broken leg and head trauma suspected. Road partially blocked. Fly to: {navaid_loc_desc} (distance: ~{distance}, bearing: {bearing_target}).
Heavy cargo truck jackknifed across lanes, crushing a car. One trapped passenger is in critical condition. Fly to: {navaid_loc_desc} (distance: ~{distance}, bearing: {bearing_target}).

highway_tertiary.q:
[out:xml][timeout:15][bbox:{{bbox}}];
way["highway"="tertiary"]["name"]({{bbox}});
out body;





A logging truck overturned on a winding rural road, trapping the driver inside. Nearby responders request air evacuation. Fly to: {navaid_loc_desc} (distance: ~{distance}, bearing: {bearing_target}).
An off-road SUV overturned while navigating a narrow tertiary route. The driver sustained thoracic injuries and cannot be moved by ground ambulance due to terrain. Fly to: {navaid_loc_desc} (distance: ~{distance}, bearing: {bearing_target}).
A motorcycle skidded on gravel while approaching a sharp bend. Rider sustained open fractures and spinal injury; terrain prevents wheeled extraction. Fly to: {navaid_loc_desc} (distance: ~{distance}, bearing: {bearing_target}).
A farm tractor and a delivery vehicle collided on a tight curve. The driver of the delivery truck is unconscious with chest injuries. Fly to: {navaid_loc_desc} (distance: ~{distance}, bearing: {bearing_target}).
An elderly woman suffered a hip fracture after a sudden stop on a rural transit minibus. Condition deteriorating—airlift recommended. Fly to: {navaid_loc_desc} (distance: ~{distance}, bearing: {bearing_target}).
An off-road vehicle struck a pedestrian walking near a farming road. Victim has multiple fractures and suspected internal bleeding. Fly to: {navaid_loc_desc} (distance: ~{distance}, bearing: {bearing_target}).
Passenger fell from the back of a moving pickup in a rural area. Head trauma suspected. Local access is limited by terrain. Fly to: {navaid_loc_desc} (distance: ~{distance}, bearing: {bearing_target}).

highway_path.q:
[out:xml][timeout:15][bbox:{{bbox}}];
way["highway"="path"]["name"][!foot][!bicycle][!segregated][!residential]({{bbox}});
out body;





Pick up an injured tourist at {navaid_loc_desc} (distance: ~{distance}, bearing: {bearing_target}). Fly to: {navaid_loc_desc} (distance: ~{distance}, bearing: {bearing_target}).
An unconscious hiker was found on "Forgotten Ridge Trail", a remote named path lacking clear foot access. Fly to: {navaid_loc_desc} (distance: ~{distance}, bearing: {bearing_target}).
A mountain biker suffered a fall on a path which lacks bicycle permissions. The trail is known for its uneven terrain and loose gravel. Fly to: {navaid_loc_desc} (distance: ~{distance}, bearing: {bearing_target}).
A telecom field technician collapsed during a terrain scan. The route lacks defined access, delaying emergency foot responders. Fly to: {navaid_loc_desc} (distance: ~{distance}, bearing: {bearing_target}).
A university cartography team was surveying a new path. One member suffered a leg fracture after slipping on wet roots. Access info on the path is unclear. Fly to: {navaid_loc_desc} (distance: ~{distance}, bearing: {bearing_target}).

