A solo climber on a high-altitude route developed severe altitude sickness. Fly to: {navaid_loc_desc} (distance: ~{distance}, bearing: {bearing_target}).
Two hikers became disoriented and stranded due to fog on {navaid_loc_desc}. They reported short supplies and hypothermia risk. Fly to: {navaid_loc_desc} (distance: ~{distance}, bearing: {bearing_target}).
An avalanche warning triggered immediate evacuation of hikers on "{navaid_loc_desc}". Trail is on steep terrain". Fly to: {navaid_loc_desc} (distance: ~{distance}, bearing: {bearing_target}).
During a guided technical ascent, a climber fell on "{navaid_loc_desc}". Rescue teams requested airlift support.  Fly to: {navaid_loc_desc} (distance: ~{distance}, bearing: {bearing_target}).
